      en: ["The interior Memorial Hall features the poignant sculpture 'The Victims' by Jozef Jankovič.", "The Slovak National Uprising was officially launched on August 29, 1944.", "The museum's archive preserves more than 200,000 documents from the World War II era.", "The open-air display includes an original Soviet Li-2 aircraft used to supply the partisans.", "The building is widely regarded as one of the most iconic examples of Slovak modernist architecture.", "Every year on August 29, the museum grounds host the central national commemorative ceremonies."],
